DESCRIPTION:This dinner is for those who are ready to take their next step 
 and formally become a "covenant member" of our local church here at Radian
 t. In a generation full of fear and anxiety with commitment\, we want to g
 row deep roots in the gospel together and become an outpost of the kingdom
  of God as a covenant community built on Jesus Christ.\n\nhttps://radiantc
 entralcoast.churchcenter.com/calendar/event/220172725
